  "contentHtml": "<div><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); border-image: none; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다.</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div><!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">학기말에 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">‘</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">지식시장</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">’</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">을 도입한 수업을 하였습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">작년 재과만 오프라인</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">부산</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">모임에서 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">‘</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">지식시장</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">’&nbsp; 수업</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">을 배웠습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">그 때 마지막 단원 진도를 나가지 않은 시기여서 우리 학교 아이들의 색깔에 맞게 적용해 보리라 다짐했습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">그동안 여력이 없어 미루고 있다가 오늘 사진 자료 등을 정리하였습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">7</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">단원을 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">6</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">개의 주제로 나누어 모둠별로 선택하도록 했습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">최소한 이런 내용은 꼭 포함되어야 한다는 기준은 정해주었고요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">동기부여를 위해 퀴즈를 맞히는 아이들에게 줄 간식도 미리 준비하였습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">작은 초콜릿</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">초코파이</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">막대 사탕의 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">3</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">종류</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">). </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">부스 운영에 퀴즈를 도입하겠다는 모둠들이 있었기 때문입니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">지식시장이 무엇인지 질문하는 학생들에게 이렇게 설명하였습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. ‘</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">김대중 컨벤션 센터에서 입시 박람회가 열렸다면 무엇을 어떻게 준비하면 될까</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">?’ </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">그리고 행사 운영자와 참여자의 역할이 모두 필요하다고 알려주었습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">모둠 안에서 준비는 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">4</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">명이 공동으로 하고</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, 2</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">명이 운영할 때 나머지 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">명은 다른 부스로 이동하며 다니는 방식으로 진행하였습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">다음 시간에는 역할을 바꾸었습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">한 부스에서 머무는 시간은 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">6</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">분으로 하고</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">소리굽쇠를 울려 이동을 알렸습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">아이들은 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">6</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">분 안에 이렇게 많은 일을 할 수 있다는 사실이 신기하다는 반응을 보였습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">지식시장 수업을 준비하고 진행하는 동안 무관심하거나 소외된 학생들이 없었습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">교내 자유학기제 성과 발표회 때 지식시장을 운영하는 우리 아이들의 행복한 모습을 동영상으로 보면서 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">‘</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">이 수업 도입하기 참 잘했다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.’</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">는 생각과 함께 저도 덩달아 기뻤습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.  </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">학생들에게 내어준 기초 자료는 아래와 같습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 13pt; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: HY울릉도M;\">자유학기제 </span></u><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: HY울릉도M; font-size: 14pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HY울릉도M;\">7</span></u><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: HY울릉도M;\">단원 지식시장</span></u></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: HY울릉도M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HY울릉도M;\">Ⅰ</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: HY울릉도M; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HY울릉도M;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: HY울릉도M;\">단계</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: HY울릉도M; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HY울릉도M;\">&gt; </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: HY울릉도M;\">모둠별 주제 선택하기</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; margin-left: 5pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">1. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">수권</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(264~267)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; margin-left: 5pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt;\"> </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-fo